	'k0fa8a8b6' => 'Next cohort begins 12 January 2027. Professional Bread &amp; Pastry runs for 6 weeks, meeting Monday through Friday from 06:00 to 14:00 with 12 seats available. Open bench mornings take place every Saturday at 09:00.',
