	'k29b992fc' => 'Dough development relies on four commercial spiral mixers of varying capacities, allowing students to mix small test batches as well as large bulk production doughs without shear stress. A heavy-duty reversible dough sheeter ensures precise, uniform butter lamination down to millimeter tolerances for laminated pastry doughs. The bakery houses a walk-in retarder-prover room maintaining exact humidity and temperature calibration between two and twenty-six degrees Celsius. This climate-controlled facility allows students to study delayed fermentation kinetics and run reliable overnight cold proofs on sourdough bâtards and shaped croissants.',
