	'k2aabe0e7' => 'Prospective applicants can contact the school registry directly by email at hello@komugischool.example or by telephone at +31 10 555 0140 during weekday office hours. We do not use generic contact forms; every inquiry is answered directly by admissions coordinator Hanne Jansen or placement director Rafael Ortega. Whether you have questions regarding 2027 cohort schedules, bursary application criteria, or housing options in Rotterdam, our administrative team provides clear, straightforward guidance to support your bakery education.',
