	'k4313cb02' => 'A fifty percent deposit is required upon formal acceptance to confirm your seat in your chosen cohort. Course fees include value added tax, all organic grains and dairy, the Komugi linen apron, a professional knife roll with essential hand tools, and the bound bench book. To support dedicated bakers with financial constraints, we provide two part-fee bursary places per cohort. Applicants interested in bursary consideration should indicate their interest during the initial online application. We do not make job placement promises or issue formal government credentials.',
