	'k68152b93' => 'We do not require prior commercial bakery experience to apply for the Professional Bread &amp; Pastry programme or our short courses. Our syllabus begins with fundamental grain chemistry, manual dough handling, and baker\'s percentages, making the instruction accessible to career switchers, cooks, and dedicated home bakers. What we look for in applicants is physical stamina, a calm temperament, attentiveness to detail, and a genuine readiness to work disciplined early morning hours from 06:00 to 14:00 at the bench.',
	'k6845510b' => 'Rafael Ortega directs student placements and professional career transitions, matching six-week graduates to two-week assignments across our eight partner kitchens. Our network includes respected regional bakeries: Maasbrood, Atelier Korenbloem, North Pier Bakehouse, Rye &amp; Ember, Le Fournil du Quai, Haven Street Bakery, Kade Patisserie, and Bakkerij Oostwal. Rafael works closely with head bakers across these kitchens to ensure our students encounter authentic commercial production rhythms and develop the workplace confidence necessary for lasting kitchen careers.',
