	'k9883d0bc' => 'A home baker who scaled her sourdough to commercial volume and opened her own bakery café after her placement.',
	'k99795adf' => 'hello@komugischool.example',
	'k9ad28976' => 'Own bakery',
	'k9aeb1a5e' => 'Yes. We offer two part-fee bursary places for every six-week Professional Bread &amp; Pastry cohort. These bursaries are intended to assist dedicated candidates who demonstrate high craft commitment but face documented financial constraints. Applicants interested in being considered for a bursary place should indicate this on their initial application form. Bursary decisions are reviewed by our admissions panel and communicated alongside standard admission offers.',
	'k9d147274' => 'Saturday and Sunday: long-fermentation hearth bread, starter care, coil folds and scoring. Leave with a levain and formula cards.',
	'k9f1fa282' => 'Sourdough Week',
	'ka02f4bc0' => 'Over six weeks of intensive work, you build an unedited production portfolio documenting shaping consistency, oven development, and crumb structures.',
