	'kbe78da07' => 'Proofing',
	'kbea30734' => 'Students train on authentic professional production equipment at our Hallstraat 14 bakery. Our facilities include three four-deck stone hearth ovens with independent digital steam controls, one rotating rack oven, four spiral mixers of varying capacity, a commercial reversible dough sheeter, and a walk-in retarder-prover room. Every student learns manual peel loading, steam timing, and routine oven maintenance during their daily production shifts.',
