	'kc13c8687' => 'Maasbrood',
	'kc212075d' => 'Graduates of the Professional Bread &amp; Pastry programme transition into professional kitchens with sound bench skills and realistic operational expectations. Every student completes two weeks in an operating partner bakery following the core course.',
	'kc27b8340' => 'A walk-in room holding exact humidity and temperature for overnight cold proofs.',
